#. module: sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "%(order)s is not an expired quotation: its prices still hold."
msgstr "%(order)s no es una cotización vencida: sus precios siguen vigentes."

#. module: sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"%(orders)s already has goods delivered or invoiced: it is not cancelled. To "
"undo it, return the goods and create the credit note from the order; with "
"nothing delivered or invoiced, it can be cancelled."
msgstr ""
"%(orders)s ya tiene mercadería entregada o facturada: no se cancela. Para "
"deshacerlo, devolvé la mercadería y hacé la nota de crédito desde el pedido;"
" sin nada entregado ni facturado, se puede cancelar."

#. module: sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl
#: model:exception.rule,description:sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl.exception_rule_urgent
msgid ""
"A Sales administrator confirms it: they ignore the exceptions and confirm."
msgstr ""
"La confirma un administrador de Ventas: ignora las excepciones y confirma."

#. module: sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl.view_order_form
msgid ""
"Brings today's prices, with the same recalculation as changing the "
"pricelist, and a new expiration date."
msgstr ""
"Trae los precios de hoy, con el mismo cálculo que al cambiar la lista de "
"precios, y un vencimiento nuevo."

