"Prices updated to today with the pricelist (manual prices and discounts were"
" replaced): the total went from %(before)s to %(after)s; the quotation is "
"valid until %(validity)s."
msgstr ""
"Precios actualizados a hoy con la lista de precios (se reemplazaron los "
"precios y descuentos puestos a mano): el total pasó de %(before)s a "
"%(after)s; la cotización vence el %(validity)s."

